      "text": "The outside-view base rate/reference class is last-print persistence from the latest same-table first-print value: July 2026 = 6.924 million. The fetched trailing first-print sequence is March 2026 6.574, April 2026 6.834, May 2026 6.903, June 2026 6.950, and July 2026 6.924 million; recent gains slowed and the latest move was a small decline, so there is no direct current signal that clears the update test for moving materially away from persistence."
